cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. For the simplicial
  complexes it computes with, cite their own sources instead: those are listed
  per catalogue in docs/PROVENANCE.md, and this repository redistributes none of
  them.
title: cohomology-tables
abstract: >-
  Cohomology rings and cup product multiplication tables for spaces with a
  simplicial model, built on the experimental hypercomplex machinery in OSCAR.
  Ships a catalogue of 203 spaces, one simplicial model per topological type,
  obtained from SageMath, Frank H. Lutz's Manifold Page and the literature; no
  triangulations are stored in the repository. Generated ring records carry a
  rebuild recipe, a SHA-256 of the canonicalised input, cocycle representatives
  and cup product structure constants.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ong
    given-names: Wern Juin Gabriel
    email: gabriel_ong@ieee.org
repository-code: "https://github.com/wgabrielong/cohomology-tables"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-09"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - algebraic topology
  - cohomology ring
  - cup product
  - simplicial complex
  - computational topology
  - OSCAR
